# Flatpak refs baked into the installer ISO for offline installs.
#
# Consumed by the live-environment build (installer/Containerfile →
# installer/iso_files/build.sh): flatpak resolves the runtime dependency
# closure during install, so only app refs belong here. Keep in sync with
# the intent of /usr/share/flatpak/preinstall.d — apps listed here are
# present right after installation; everything else in preinstall.d installs
# in the background on first boot via flatpak-preinstall.service.
#
# Kept offline: the app store and the default browser — the two things a
# fresh install needs immediately, before any network-dependent setup.
# Locale refs are NOT bundled (they would add ~770 MB to the ISO): offline
# installs are English-first, and flatpak-preinstall pulls the Locale refs
# on the first online boot after installation.
app/io.github.kolunmi.Bazaar/x86_64/stable
app/net.waterfox.waterfox/x86_64/stable
